          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Unfinished Swan is a game about exploring the unknown.\n\nThe player is a young boy chasing after a swan who has wandered off into a surreal, unfinished kingdom. The game begins in a completely white space where players can throw paint to splatter their surroundings and reveal the world around them.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
